Sage Nishakara meditates and answers grieving Sampati --- Promises Sampati new wings, eyes and strength --- Foretells Rama exile with Lakshmana and Sita abduction by Ravana --- Describes Sita refusing food and receiving Indra-given sustenance --- Foretells Rama-bound offering and coming monkey messengers --- Bids Sampati await time and inform searchers --- Declares Sampati will serve gods and princes --- Sage longs to see Rama and Lakshmana before casting off body